{"id":1050402,"chapter_id":1050402,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"<i>“西南之地荒无人烟，只有光秃秃的山体和枯坏的树木。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"越过荒原，在荒原的那边，会有什么呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"<i>“法师爱缇爬上了干枯的巨树，往远处眺望。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"啊？这……这哪有巨树……","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"爱缇急忙四处张望，最后目光停留在放风区的路灯上。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"她斜着眼睛看了看你，嗖地一声跳上了路灯。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"……咳咳。","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"<i>“眺望远处，法师爱缇发现了一个不小的聚落。或许想办法到那去，能收集到一些相关的信息。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"可是我现在什么都没有，过去可不是个简单的事呢……","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"那先让我观察一下，这附近都有些什么吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"你拿出骰子，蹲在地上轻轻一抛。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"不愧是我，大成功哦~！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"<i>“法师爱缇仔细观察着附近的情况，她看到在她的右手边，有两位女性正在谈论着什么，她们的手里，还拿着一袋面包。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"噢哟！面包！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"爱缇的眼睛噌地一下亮了，朝着那两人的方向跑去。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"海拉","content":"啊……啊哈，我的老伙计，你在这里做些什么呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"九十九","content":"寻找食物。","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哦！原来是食物啊！这缺……确实是踏上冒险旅途的必备物品！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"海拉站在围墙脚下，伸出手来，朝着九十九的肩膀拍了三下，眼神不住地往你这边飘。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"<i>“法师爱缇来到两位女性的身边，更加清楚地看到了她们正在做什么。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"嗨~两位朋友~！你们也是冒险家吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"爱缇的眼睛在海拉和九十九身上滴溜溜地转了一圈。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我刚才听你们说，你们在寻找食物？","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我看这地方荒无人烟的，怎么会有食物呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"speaker":"九十九","content":"嗯……我，我知道在这之前，有一位身穿灰色风衣的家伙，在这里……","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"九十九","content":"在这里埋了一袋粮食。","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"九十九","content":"我很饿，就把它挖出来了。","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"九十九比划着，眼神不自觉地看向你。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"content":"在爱缇的身后，你悄悄给九十九竖了个拇指。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"原来如此，谢谢你的坦诚~","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"content":"爱缇哼哼地笑了两声，转头对你说。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我要对她们两个进行法术攻击！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"海拉","content":"什么？！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"海拉","content":"为什么一上来就攻击我们啊！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"海拉","content":"这怎么还有比我还不讲道理的人！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"这不是很显而易见吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我现在装备不多，也没有粮食，如果要进行冒险的话，当然要收集粮食啦！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"海拉","content":"唔唔唔！！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"海拉嘟起嘴巴，皱着眉头看着爱缇，似乎下一秒就要跳起来打人了。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"你连忙走到二人中间，拉了拉二人的衣角。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"咳咳。没事的，没事的，你们也可以反击嘛。","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"speaker":"海拉","content":"你、你等着！我让九十九把你揍得找不着北！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"海拉顺势蹲下来，扛着水管，俨然一副街头小混混的模样。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"<i>“根据主动值计算，身为法师的爱缇将在这一回合内进行先手攻击。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"options":["投掷骰子"],"style":6,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402045,"trial_step":45,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"投掷骰子","goto":46}]},{"step":46,"content":"你再次转动骰子，骨碌碌声响后，骰子定格在了10上。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"<i>“为了抢夺粮食，法师爱缇朝她刚见面的两位冒险家发起了攻击，她的攻击刁钻而刻薄，直直命中了其中一位……”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"抱歉了，我的朋友——","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"content":"还没等你说完，爱缇就拿出她的法杖，往后大跳一步，对准眼前的两人高声喊道。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"<i>“冷冻射线——RAY OF FROST——”</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"一阵风吹过，爱缇维持着她的姿势，而海拉和九十九在她的一步之外，歪着脑袋同样地看向爱缇。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"……","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"海拉&九十九","content":"……","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"GM（管理者）……","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"啊！哦哦！","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"看到爱缇投射来的冰冷视线，你赶忙继续投掷骰子。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"content":"骰子滚动到爱缇脚下，出现一个大大的8。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"content":"<i>“法师的法术命中了……呃，野蛮人九十九，她受到了呃，我算一下……”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"content":"<i>“嗯，我们可怜的野蛮人九十九，受到了合计五点的伤害，并且由于法术的影响，九十九，你得停止一回合的行动。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"speaker":"九十九","content":"法术的影响……","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"<size=30>九十九，装个样子，配合一下。</size>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"speaker":"九十九","content":"嗯……啊。","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"九十九往后一退，坐在了地上，海拉见状猛地挡在了九十九前面，挥舞着水管大声嚷嚷。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"speaker":"海拉","content":"可……可恶！我，我会讨回来的！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"content":"<i>“娇小的游荡者气急败坏地跺着脚，发誓要从爱缇身上讨回公道。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"海拉","content":"吃我一记大铁管吧！！！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"海拉双手握着水管，对着爱缇的魔杖。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"你蹲下身来，在海拉面前轻轻地一抛骰子。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"<i>“2点。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"content":"<i>“游荡者海拉使用了简易武器——水管进行攻击。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"content":"<i>“根据点数计算，法师爱缇合计受到……呃……1点攻击。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哈？！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"海拉","content":"#￥%#￥%%……&￥&*&……（……%##￥￥@！@#…………&！！！！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"你在说什么……","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"content":"<i>“咳咳咳，眼见攻击效果并不显著，游荡者海拉发动了游荡者语来发泄情绪和传递信息，她所说的话在他人耳中，仿佛电报声一般刺耳而又神秘。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"<i>“若是想要解读游荡者海拉所传递的讯息，需要学习符文标识等技能，并且投掷大成功，或者耗费幸运……”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"不必了，现在你们有两条路，继续和我打——我有把握在下一场的对决中，彻底解决这位野蛮人朋友。","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"又或者……你们可以把粮食给我。","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"content":"爱缇把魔杖一收，得意地晃了晃头上的帽子——那让她那帽子上的龙角显得耀武扬威。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"content":"<i>“面对法师爱缇的挑衅，游荡者海拉显得更加愤怒，不顾一切地冲了上来。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"海拉","content":"啊？哦哦哦哇哇哇哇哇！！！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"content":"海拉反应了一下，拿起自己的水管，冲向爱缇。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"content":"<i>“然而，挥舞水管的时候力道没掌握好，把九十九放在一旁的面包袋子，抡上了围墙。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"content":"听到点名，九十九抬起头来，思考了一下力道后，将那个褐色的布袋，扔到了围墙的铁丝网上。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"speaker":"海拉","content":"……","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"content":"……","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"……","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"GM（管理者）也太光明正大地作弊了吧？！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"content":"但这是一个很合情合理的情节发展，一切皆有可能不是吗？","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"唔唔唔唔！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"content":"<i>“世界处于黑暗中时，便更加考验人与人之间的团结和信任。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"content":"<i>“即使一个无法飞翔的人，若能与伙伴同行，也将能达到她前所未有的高度。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"content":"<i>“如今没有口粮，别说是三个人，就算是只有一人也无法去到最近的城镇。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"speaker":"海拉","content":"啊？那就是非让我们拿着那袋面包走不可？","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"speaker":"海拉","content":"这限制也太多了吧！喂！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"倒也不是没有道理，没有食物的话，我们可能没办法活下去。","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"speaker":"九十九","content":"所以……面包现在有危险，但我们都需要面包。","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"content":"爱缇海拉以及九十九，走近围墙，抬头看着那袋面包，各怀着自己的小心思。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"content":"<i>“三位冒险家观察起了围墙，她们惊讶的发现，以她们目前个人所掌握的技能与力量，无法安全地将面包从围墙电网上拿下来。”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"啊？！这么矮的围墙我也拿不到吗？！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_100"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"content":"爱缇不可置信地看着你，而你眼观鼻鼻观心，打开手掌，上面密密麻麻全是小抄。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"content":"见你不理她，爱缇便知道所谓的“主宰者规则”又奏效了，她哼了一声，仔细地思考了一会儿后，来到了海拉面前。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"怎么样，要合作吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"content":"海拉放下水管，撑在地上，翘着嘴角笑了笑。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"speaker":"海拉","content":"合作？那面包本来就是我们的！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"可是你们被我打败了呀？","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_106"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"况且，你们一个游荡者，一个野蛮人，没有法师的帮忙，就算有面包，很难在冒险中活下来的——谁会在战斗中给你们加攻加防，又是谁会在你们受伤的时候为你们加血治疗……","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_107"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"speaker":"海拉","content":"唔……别的不说，九十九战斗起来，确实需要一个奶妈。","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_108"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"那~要跟我合作吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"content":"爱缇笑眯眯地伸出了手，在海拉面前晃了晃。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"content":"海拉看着爱缇，眼珠子转了一圈后，用两只手紧紧地握住了爱缇。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"speaker":"海拉","content":"好啊！那……你找到宝藏了，要分我们三分之一！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"什……？","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_113"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"content":"<i>“法师爱缇与游荡者海拉握住了双手，三人愉快地达成了合作的共识！”</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"content":"像是为了堵住爱缇接下来的台词，你连忙一边说话，一边将三人再次推到了围墙之下。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"speaker":"海拉","content":"嘿嘿，我亲爱的朋友，让我们一起接受命运的指引，前去探索传说中的城堡吧！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_116"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"speaker":"九十九","content":"好好利用我的力量！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_117"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"content":"手还在被海拉握着，爱缇的体温一向有些低，被握住的手，温度高得让她无法忽视。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"content":"好一会儿，爱缇才又抬起头来。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"哎……好吧，冒险旅途总是同伴越多越好……就算是要和我一起分享宝藏……","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_120"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"不过，既然如此，那冒险就听我的指挥，没意见吧？毕竟……我是最厉害的嘛。","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_121"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"speaker":"海拉","content":"嗯……行！就当你是最厉害的！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"speaker":"九十九","content":"嗯……","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_123"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402123,"trial_step":123},{"step":124,"spe